The '''Grand Colosseum''' is a location within the [[Party Realm]].

== Appearance ==
The Grand Colosseum is a giant landmark, taking place on a floating island over the top of the clouds in the Party Realm, sandwiched between the [[Oni Realm]] and the [[Celestial Domain]] surrounded by floating pillars representing their respective areas. It acts as a junction for the Oni Realm and the Celestial Domain. This island accomodates nearly all common [[NPCs]], including [[fighting Styles|fighting style]] teachers, Misc. NPCs such as the [[Nerd]], [[Titles Specialist]] and [[Tort]], Shop NPCs like [[Plokster]] and the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]] and most importantly the [[Party Gacha]]. The island is very similar to the Colosseum from both the [[Colosseum (First Sea)|First]] and [[Colosseum (Second Sea)|Second]] Seas.

Inside the island lies a central arena in which players can engage in no-gain-no-loss FFA PvP, and outside of the arena, PvP remains disabled. The interior is decorated with colorful assets, giving the overall space a celebration theme. [[Trading|Trading Tables]] are also made available at the left side relative to the main spawn. [[Ranked PvP|Ranked 2v2 PvP matches]] can also be participated in by stepping on plates at the matchmaking area, nearby the trading area.

